# The Manhattanville Neuroscience Outreach Program (MNOP): A Cooperative Education Model.

**Authors:** Bettica, Annemarie

## Abstract
The Manhattanville (New York) College Neuroscience Outreach Program is a research-based effort that presents different topics in neuroscience to science students in local middle schools. The program aims to provide a forum for curriculum development and teaching, enhance a cooperative internal community, and increase student awareness of the neuroscience field. (MLH)

